  "instructions": [
    "heat the binchotan charcoal in the cataplana vessel over medium heat until it begins to smoke",
    "add the olive oil to the cataplana and swirl it around to coat the bottom",
    "add the lamb shoulder to the cataplana and sear it until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes",
    "add the sliced red onion and red bell pepper to the cataplana and cook until they are tender, about 10 minutes",
    "add the red chilli flakes to the cataplana and stir to combine",
    "add the chicken broth, beef broth, and tomato paste to the cataplana and stir to combine",
    "bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 2 hours",
    "stir in the honey, salt, and black pepper",
    "serve the lamb and vegetables hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired"
  ],
